@startuml
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1f2937
skinparam ArrowColor #5b6b8c
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1f2937
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam PackageBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam ClassBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam ClassFontColor #1f2937
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam StateBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam StateFontColor #1f2937
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fef3c7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d97706
skinparam NoteFontColor #1f2937
' BrewLite A2 §4.2 - UC-04, SRS 3.4-3.6, FR-10..16, FR-20, BR-05/10/11, NFR-05/06/13
' VNPay sandbox flow: docs/planning/2026-10-29-vnpay-payment-plan.md, sections 1.3, 1.5, 1.6
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F6F9FB
hide footbox
title BrewLite A2 - Sequence: UC-04 Checkout (VNPay sandbox)
autonumber
actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Next.js UI" as UI
participant "NestJS API" as API
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "VNPay sandbox\n(Payment Service)" as Pay

== E1a: entry and authentication ==
Customer -> UI : Open cart; press Checkout
alt No Customer JWT (E1a)
  UI --> Customer : Navigate /login?next=/checkout; retain cart
  Customer -> UI : Submit login
  UI -> API : POST /auth/login (credentials)
  API -> DB : Verify user and passwordHash
  DB --> API : User role CUSTOMER
  API --> UI : 200 JWT
  UI --> Customer : Return to /checkout with cart
else Already authenticated
  UI --> Customer : Show checkout summary
end
Customer -> UI : Select WALLET or CARD; press Pay with VNPay
UI -> UI : Disable button; generate Idempotency-Key (no card field)

== UC-04.1: order creation ==
UI -> API : POST /orders (JWT, items: productId/size/toppings/quantity)
API -> API : JWT guard and role CUSTOMER
alt Missing / expired JWT (E1a)
  API --> UI : 401 UNAUTHORIZED; no Order
  UI --> Customer : Redirect /login?next=/checkout; keep cart
  Customer -> UI : Sign in as Customer
  UI -> API : POST /auth/login
  API --> UI : 200 refreshed JWT
  UI -> API : Retry POST /orders with SAME cart (no existing orderId)
  API -> API : Recheck JWT and CUSTOMER role
else Valid Customer JWT
end
API -> API : Validate DTO (BR-02); reject client prices (BR-01)
alt Bad DTO / unknown product (E6)
  API --> UI : 400 VALIDATION_ERROR / 404 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
  UI --> Customer : Fix cart; no Order created; stop checkout
else DTO accepted
  API -> DB : Read Product prices and options
  DB --> API : Product records
  API -> API : Compute unitPrice, lineTotal and Order.total
  group Transaction T1: recipe locks, ingredient reservation, snapshot (FR-11/13; NFR-13)
    API -> DB : BEGIN; lock recipes in ID order; read base + topping recipes\nAggregate ingredient quantities across ALL cart lines\nLock Ingredient rows in ID order; check onHand - reserved
    alt Missing/invalid recipe or ingredient shortage (E2)
      DB --> API : Recipe unavailable or aggregate ingredient shortage
      API -> DB : ROLLBACK (no Order, OrderItem, snapshot or balance change)
      API --> UI : 409 RECIPE_UNAVAILABLE / OUT_OF_STOCK + ingredient details
      UI --> Customer : Back to cart; highlight insufficient items
    else All recipes valid and aggregate demand fits
      API -> DB : Increase Ingredient.reserved; INSERT Order(PENDING, inventoryTracked=true)\nINSERT OrderItems and immutable aggregate OrderIngredient snapshot
      DB --> API : COMMIT T1; orderId, total
      API --> UI : 201 { id:orderId, status:PENDING, total }
      UI -> UI : Persist orderId/owner/key to continue same order
    end
  end
end
note over UI,API : Only the successful POST /orders branch continues to payment.

== UC-04.2 (1/3): create Payment PENDING and signed VNPay URL ==
note over API,Pay
  HTTP calls to VNPay (QueryDR) are always made OUTSIDE any DB transaction that holds the Order lock.
  Signing the payment URL is local HMAC-SHA512; it needs no network call.
end note
UI -> API : POST /payments (JWT, orderId, paymentMethod)\nHeader Idempotency-Key
API -> API : JWT guard + CUSTOMER role
alt Expired JWT after Order exists (E1b)
  API --> UI : 401 UNAUTHORIZED; no Payment or new Order
  UI --> Customer : Re-login SAME account; retain cart, orderId and key
  Customer -> UI : Log in as original Customer
  UI -> API : POST /auth/login
  API --> UI : 200 new JWT
  UI -> API : GET /orders/:id (new JWT)
  API -> DB : Verify owner and load current order
  DB --> API : Current Order or ownership mismatch
  alt Different owner (403) / CANCELLED / already PAID+
    API --> UI : 403 or 200 current status
    UI --> Customer : Require original account or show current order\nNo additional POST /orders or Payment
  else PENDING or PAYMENT_FAILED, owner verified
    API --> UI : 200 payable order
    UI -> API : Retry POST /payments SAME orderId and key (new JWT)
    API -> API : Revalidate Customer identity
  end
else JWT valid
end
API -> API : Validate payment DTO + key (E6)
API -> DB : Read Order (no lock yet); verify owner (E7)
DB --> API : Order or 403/404
alt Invalid payment DTO/key or wrong order (E6/E7)
  API --> UI : 400 VALIDATION_ERROR / IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REQUIRED\nor 403 FORBIDDEN / 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
  UI --> Customer : Explain error; keep cart; no Payment created
else Valid body, owner verified
  API -> DB : Lookup SUCCESS by owner + orderId + key + paymentMethod (BR-05)
  DB --> API : Original SUCCESS or no match
  alt E4a: successful replay
    API --> UI : 200 { paymentId, orderId, orderStatus:PAID, amount, status:SUCCESS }
    note over API,Pay : Replay needs no signing, no VNPay configuration and no new Payment.
    UI --> Customer : Show PAID receipt; clear cart
  else New payment request, no SUCCESS match
    alt Order not PENDING/PAYMENT_FAILED (E4d/E7)
      API --> UI : 409 ORDER_NOT_PAYABLE; no Payment, no URL
      UI --> Customer : Show current order status
    else Order payable
      opt E11: latest Payment PENDING is past expiresAt
        API -> Pay : POST querydr (vnp_TxnRef, gatewayCreateDate)\nOutside any DB transaction; 10 s timeout
        Pay --> API : vnp_ResponseCode + vnp_TransactionStatus (signed)
        API -> API : Verify response signature, merchant, TxnRef; amount for 00
        group Transaction T3: apply QueryDR result (same applyGatewayResult as IPN)
          API -> DB : BEGIN; lock Order; re-read THAT Payment\nIf IPN finalized it meanwhile: keep DB state, discard stale result
          alt 00/00 paid
            API -> DB : Payment SUCCESS; consume snapshot (onHand AND reserved); Order PAID; COMMIT
          else 00/02 final failure
            API -> DB : Payment FAILED (codes kept apart); Order PAYMENT_FAILED; COMMIT
          else 91 after expiry (verified), or grace elapsed without a verdict (D6)
            API -> DB : Payment FAILED, gatewayResponseCode="EXPIRED"; Order PAYMENT_FAILED; COMMIT
            note right of DB : D6: now >= expiresAt + 15 min (isPastGrace) with 00/01, unsupported status,\nanother code, BAD_RESPONSE or no verified answer -> FAILED + "EXPIRED", warning PAYMENT_EXPIRED_UNCONFIRMED.\nEXPIRED is an internal gatewayResponseCode, not a PaymentStatus.
          else 00/01 inside the grace, or 91 before expiry
            API -> DB : ROLLBACK; Payment stays PENDING
            note right of DB : QueryDR 00/01 keeps PENDING only until expiresAt + 15 min,\nthen the branch above closes it. Closed only on a call; no background job.
          else 04/05/06/07/09 or MISMATCH (never auto-closed), or an unanswered query inside the grace
            API -> DB : ROLLBACK; DB unchanged; warning if money may have moved
            note right of DB : MISMATCH applies to a signed 00 response only. Any other code (91 too) with a wrong or\nmissing merchant or TxnRef is BAD_RESPONSE: 502 inside the grace, closed after it.
          end
        end
      end
      alt Reconciliation found SUCCESS: Order now PAID (E11)
        alt Same owner + orderId + key + paymentMethod (BR-05 checked FIRST)
          API --> UI : 200 SUCCESS replay (E4a)
          UI --> Customer : Show PAID receipt; clear cart
        else Different key or method
          API --> UI : 409 ORDER_NOT_PAYABLE
          UI --> Customer : Show current order status
        end
      else Payment still PENDING after reconciliation (E11)
        API --> UI : 409 PAYMENT_IN_PROGRESS; no new URL, no new Payment (BR-10)
        UI --> Customer : "Checking payment" with Check again button; do not advise paying twice
      else QueryDR failed inside the grace: network, signature or configuration (E13)
        API --> UI : 502 PAYMENT_PROVIDER_ERROR; DB and Order unchanged (past the grace the Payment is closed, D6)
        UI --> Customer : Generic error; keep cart and orderId
      else Payment PENDING within expiresAt (E4 / A6)
        alt Same paymentMethod
          API --> UI : 200 SAME paymentUrl + expiresAt, even with a new key\nNo new Payment, no re-signing
        else Different paymentMethod
          API --> UI : 409 PAYMENT_IN_PROGRESS
          UI --> Customer : Continue the existing payment or check status
        end
      else No open Payment: create a new attempt
        alt Missing VNP_TMN_CODE / VNP_HASH_SECRET / WEB_URL (E13)
          API --> UI : 502 PAYMENT_PROVIDER_ERROR; no Payment, Order unchanged
          UI --> Customer : Generic error; keep cart and orderId
        else Configuration complete
          API -> API : Build and sign URL (HMAC-SHA512, local)\nvnp_TxnRef=Payment.id; vnp_Amount=amount x 100; GMT+7 create/expire dates (+15 min)
          group Transaction T2: Payment PENDING (no HTTP call inside this lock)
            API -> DB : BEGIN; lock Order; re-read open Payment (BR-10)\nINSERT Payment(PENDING, paymentUrl, expiresAt, gatewayCreateDate, idempotencyKey)
            opt A3: retry after a FAILED attempt
              API -> DB : UPDATE Order PAYMENT_FAILED -> PENDING (snapshot kept; no new reservation)
            end
            DB --> API : COMMIT T2; one Payment PENDING; Order PENDING
          end
          API --> UI : 201 { paymentId, orderId, orderStatus:PENDING, amount,\nstatus:PENDING, paymentUrl, expiresAt }
          UI -> UI : Save { orderId, key, paymentId, paymentMethod } in sessionStorage; keep cart
          UI -> Browser : window.location.assign(paymentUrl)
        end
      end
    end
  end
end
opt A6: Customer returns to checkout while the Payment PENDING is still valid
  UI -> API : GET /orders/:id (JWT)
  API --> UI : 200 order with payments[ ] (paymentUrl, expiresAt)
  UI --> Customer : Show "Continue payment"; no new URL
  UI -> Browser : window.location.assign(OLD paymentUrl)
end

== UC-04.2 (2/3): customer pays on VNPay; IPN ==
Browser -> Pay : GET paymentUrl (VNPay payment page)
Customer -> Pay : Enter NCB test card and OTP on the VNPay page\n(BrewLite never receives card data)
Pay -> API : GET /payments/vnpay/ipn?vnp_* (server-to-server, public, no JWT)
API -> API : Check VNP configuration; verify HMAC-SHA512 signature and vnp_TmnCode
alt Configuration missing (E13)
  API --> Pay : {"RspCode":"99"}; no DB read or write; VNPay retries later
else Invalid signature or merchant (E9)
  API --> Pay : {"RspCode":"97","Message":"Invalid signature"}; DB unchanged
else Signature valid
  API -> DB : Find Payment by vnp_TxnRef
  DB --> API : Payment or none
  alt No Payment for vnp_TxnRef
    API --> Pay : {"RspCode":"01"}
  else vnp_Amount differs from Payment.amount x 100 (E9)
    API --> Pay : {"RspCode":"04"}; DB unchanged
  else Payment found, amount matches
    group Transaction T3: applyGatewayResult (shared with QueryDR)
      API -> DB : BEGIN; lock Order; re-read Payment and Order
      alt Payment not PENDING, or Order not PENDING
        opt E12: success IPN after FAILED / EXPIRED, CANCELLED order, or paid by another Payment
          API -> API : Log warning PAYMENT_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED with vnp_TxnRef\nStaff checks Merchant Admin and refunds by hand
        end
        API --> Pay : {"RspCode":"02"}; Order, Payment and stock unchanged\n(a repeated IPN for an already successful Payment only gets 02)
      else vnp_ResponseCode=00 AND vnp_TransactionStatus=00 (success)
        API -> DB : UPDATE Payment SUCCESS (gatewayTxnNo, bankCode, paidAt, both gateway codes)\nIf inventoryTracked: lock ingredients in ID order; decrease onHand AND reserved by snapshot\nUPDATE Order -> PAID; COMMIT
        DB --> API : One Payment SUCCESS; Order PAID
        API --> Pay : {"RspCode":"00","Message":"Confirm Success"}
      else vnp_TransactionStatus=02 (E3 failure)
        note right of DB : IPN counts as failed when vnp_TransactionStatus = 02,\nincluding a customer Cancel (vnp_ResponseCode 24) and an OTP-step timeout (15).
        API -> DB : UPDATE Payment FAILED (gatewayResponseCode, gatewayTransactionStatus kept apart)\nUPDATE Order -> PAYMENT_FAILED; onHand, reserved and snapshot unchanged; COMMIT
        DB --> API : Payment FAILED; Order PAYMENT_FAILED
        API --> Pay : {"RspCode":"00"}
      else Status 01, reversal/refund group, unsupported or conflicting codes
        API -> DB : ROLLBACK; DB unchanged
        API --> Pay : {"RspCode":"99"}; warning if money may have moved
      end
    end
  end
end

== UC-04.2 (3/3): return page, polling and optional QueryDR ==
Pay --> Browser : Redirect to vnp_ReturnUrl /payment/vnpay-return?vnp_*
Browser -> UI : Load return page (display only; never decides the result, BR-11)
UI -> API : GET /payments/vnpay/return?vnp_* (public; no DB write)
API -> API : Verify signature and vnp_TmnCode
alt Invalid signature/merchant, unknown Payment or configuration missing (E9/E13)
  API --> UI : { valid:false }; no IDs taken from the unverified query
  UI -> UI : Recover only orderId/paymentId stored in this customer's sessionStorage
else Verified
  API -> DB : Read Payment by vnp_TxnRef
  DB --> API : Payment
  API --> UI : { valid:true, paymentId, orderId, responseCode }
end
loop every 2 s, at most 30 s, until a final state
  UI -> API : GET /orders/:id (JWT)
  API -> DB : Read Order and payments
  DB --> API : Order status; payments with paymentUrl, expiresAt, gateway codes
  API --> UI : 200 order detail
end
opt E10: Payment still PENDING (IPN lost or late: Render asleep, or local run with no IPN)
  UI -> API : POST /payments/:id/sync (JWT; one call, no retry loop)
  API -> DB : Verify Payment and Order owner
  DB --> API : Payment/Order or 401/403/404 PAYMENT_NOT_FOUND
  alt Payment already SUCCESS / FAILED
    API --> UI : 200 { paymentId, orderId, orderStatus, status } from DB; no QueryDR
  else Payment PENDING (even before expiry)
    API -> Pay : POST querydr (outside any DB transaction; 10 s timeout)
    Pay --> API : vnp_ResponseCode + vnp_TransactionStatus (signed)
    API -> API : Verify response signature, merchant, TxnRef; amount for 00
    alt Inside the grace: network/timeout, bad or missing signature (UNSIGNED), config missing, BAD_RESPONSE or another query code (E13)
      API --> UI : 502 PAYMENT_PROVIDER_ERROR; DB unchanged
    else MISMATCH of a 00 response (wrong amount, merchant, TxnRef or type), or 00 with 04/05/06/07/09 (never auto-closed)
      API --> UI : 502 PAYMENT_PROVIDER_ERROR; DB unchanged; reconciliation warning
    else Grace elapsed (now >= expiresAt + 15 min) with no verdict: 00/01, unsupported status, another code, BAD_RESPONSE or no verified answer (D6, E11)
      API -> DB : BEGIN; lock Order; re-read THAT Payment; if still PENDING:\nPayment FAILED, gatewayResponseCode="EXPIRED"; Order PAYMENT_FAILED; COMMIT
      API --> UI : 200 { orderStatus:PAYMENT_FAILED, status:FAILED }; warning PAYMENT_EXPIRED_UNCONFIRMED
    else Verified response
      group Transaction T3: applyGatewayResult (same function as IPN; mapping of E11)
        API -> DB : BEGIN; lock Order; re-read THAT Payment; keep the DB state if IPN already finalized it
        alt 00/00 paid
          API -> DB : Payment SUCCESS; consume snapshot once; Order PAID; COMMIT
          API --> UI : 200 { orderStatus:PAID, status:SUCCESS }
        else 00/02 final failure
          API -> DB : Payment FAILED; Order PAYMENT_FAILED; COMMIT
          API --> UI : 200 { orderStatus:PAYMENT_FAILED, status:FAILED }
        else Not concluded inside the grace: 00/01, or 91 before expiry (91 after expiry: see E11)
          API -> DB : ROLLBACK; Payment stays PENDING
          API --> UI : 409 PAYMENT_IN_PROGRESS
        end
      end
    end
  end
end
alt DB says Order PAID / PREPARING / READY / COMPLETED
  UI -> UI : Clear cart and checkout session of exactly this order
  UI --> Customer : Show paid receipt, order code, tracking (FR-20)
else DB says Order PAYMENT_FAILED (E3)
  UI --> Customer : Failure message by response code (24 cancelled, 11/15/EXPIRED expired, 51 insufficient funds, other generic)\nKeep cart and orderId; offer Retry (A3, back to POST /payments) or Cancel (A5)
else Payment PENDING, or 409 / 502 from sync
  UI --> Customer : "Checking payment, please check again"; Check again button\nNever advise paying a second time
end

== UC-06: owner cancellation of unpaid order (FR-25 Must) ==
opt Owner chooses cancel while PENDING / PAYMENT_FAILED
  Customer -> UI : Confirm cancel
  UI -> API : PATCH /orders/:id {status:CANCELLED} + JWT
  API -> DB : Verify owner; read Order and its latest Payment (no lock held)
  opt E11: latest Payment PENDING is past expiresAt
    API -> Pay : POST querydr (outside any DB transaction)
    Pay --> API : vnp_ResponseCode + vnp_TransactionStatus (signed)
    API -> DB : BEGIN; lock Order; re-read THAT Payment; apply the E11 mapping; COMMIT
  end
  API -> DB : BEGIN; lock Order; re-read Payment; check owner and transition
  alt Payment PENDING within expiresAt, or still unresolved (A5 blocked)
    API -> DB : ROLLBACK; no balance changes
    API --> UI : 409 PAYMENT_IN_PROGRESS (502 PAYMENT_PROVIDER_ERROR if QueryDR failed)
    UI --> Customer : Explain payment in progress; continue (A6) or check status
  else Valid unpaid order, inventoryTracked=true, no unresolved Payment
    API -> DB : Lock ingredients in ID order; decrease reserved by snapshot\nKeep onHand unchanged; set CANCELLED; COMMIT
    API --> UI : 200 CANCELLED
  else Legacy inventoryTracked=false
    API -> DB : Restore original Product.stock quantities; set CANCELLED; COMMIT
    API --> UI : 200 CANCELLED; no ingredient changes
  else Repeated cancel / paid / wrong owner
    API -> DB : ROLLBACK; no balance changes
    API --> UI : 409 invalid state / 403 forbidden
  end
end
note over API,DB
  Legacy false-marker orders preserve original Product.stock payment/cancel lifecycle.
  New true-marker orders use snapshot, never current recipes for consume/release.
  Ingredients are released only by owner cancellation, never because a Payment became FAILED/EXPIRED.
  No automatic cancellation or reservation expiry.
end note
@enduml
